


<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="keywords" content="BAND" />
    <meta name="description" content="BAND" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <style type="text/css">
        html, body, div, dl, dt, dd, ul, ol, li, h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, pre, form, fieldset, input, p, blockquote, th, td{margin:0; padding:0;font-size:100%;line-height:1.5;}
        body, td, select, textarea, input, span, div, p, li, a, label, pre{font-size:12px;line-height:150%;font-family:"나눔고딕","NanumGothic","NanumGothicOTF", "맑은고딕", "Malgun Gothic", dotum,verdana, "Trebuchet MS", "Lucida Grande", "Tahoma","Helvetica","Arial", "hiragino kaku gothic pro", sans-serif;}
        input[type=text]{line-height:1;font-family:"나눔고딕", "NanumGothic", "NanumGothicOTF","맑은고딕", "Malgun Gothic", dotum,verdana,"Trebuchet MS", "Lucida Grande", "Tahoma","Helvetica","Arial",sans-serif;}
        ol, ul, li{list-style:none;}
        address, caption, cite, code, dfn, em, strong, th, var, i{font-style:normal;}
        strong{font-weight:bold;}
        table{border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;}
        td{overflow-wrap: break-word}
        img,fieldset{border:0;}
        img{border:0;vertical-align:top;}
        a{text-decoration:none;}

        .simple_msg{width:100%;padding:72px 0;text-align:center;}
        .simple_msg h1{padding:0 0 19px;}
        .simple_msg .msg_title{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#333;}
        .simple_msg p{padding:9px 0 26px;font-size:14px;color:#777;}
        .simple_msg .done{height:46px;padding:0 50px;line-height:46px;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;border:0;border-right:1px solid #39c86a;border-bottom:1px solid #39c86a;border-radius:3px;background:#3cd370;}

        .simple_msg._404{position:fixed;left:0;top:50%;margin-top:-114px;padding:0;}
        .simple_msg._404 .msg_title{font-size:24px;}
        .simple_msg._404 p{padding-top:15px;}
        .simple_msg .history_back{height:auto;text-decoration:underline;color:#898989;border:0;background:none;}
    </style>
    <title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</title>
</head>
<body>
<div class="simple_msg _404">
    <h1><img src="https://ssl.pstatic.net/static/bandweb/static/band-icon/band_123x45.png" alt="BAND" width="123" height="45" /></h1>
    <strong class="msg_title">페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</strong>
    <p>방문하시려는 페이지의 주소가 잘못입력되었거나,<br />페이지의 주소가 변경 혹은 삭제되어 요청하신 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.<br />입력하신 주소가 정확한지 다시 한번 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.</p>
    <button type="button" class="history_back" onclick="history.back(); return false;">이전 페이지로</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
